title: 'pallet-revive: support finalized/safe/pending block tags in eth_getLogs'
doc:
- audience: Node Dev
  description: |-
    The `eth_getLogs` filter resolved only explicit block numbers and the `earliest` and
    `latest` tags, rejecting `finalized`, `safe` and `pending` with an "Unsupported tag"
    error even though the rest of the eth-rpc server (e.g. `eth_getBalance`, `eth_call`)
    already accepts them. All standard block tags are now resolved: `safe` and `finalized`
    map to the latest finalized block and `pending` maps to `latest`, consistent with the
    other block-tag handling in the server.
crates:
- name: pallet-revive-eth-rpc
  bump: patch
